QFront v1.0.0 - FidoNet Mailer for PCBoard 15.4
================================================
Clean-room FidoNet front-end mailer and mail
processor. EMSI/YooHoo/FTS-1 handshake, Zmodem/
Xmodem transfer, BSO outbound, 19-flag event
scheduler, Areafix robot, nodelist compiler,
file requests. 5 DOS4G binaries + Linux.
21 source files, 10,123 lines. GPLv3.
pcbirc crew 2026 - github.com/verta1878/pcbirc
